# GSL test node only. Its Cloudflare zone adds X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
# to every response, which blanks any cross-origin embed. Browsers ignore
# X-Frame-Options when a CSP frame-ancestors directive is present, so this
# re-opens embedding for the listed origins. frame-ancestors checks every
# ancestor, not just the parent, so a nested embed must list each origin
# in its chain. file: admits demo pages opened from disk (Chrome and
# Firefox only; Safari still refuses). Host-scoped so production stays
# open to any embedder (docs/WORDPRESS_INTEGRATION_PLAN.md).
https://terraviz.test.gsl.noaa.gov/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self' https://gsl.noaa.gov file:
